{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"2eb3fca0-02ee-4064-a21b-6f7d494bc3a9","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The launchd job was never reporting because:\n\n* the script path in the plist pointed to a non‑existent location,\n* the script lacked execute permission,\n* it used `$HOME`‑based paths that don’t exist in the snapshot,\n* it called GNU `date` with the macOS‑specific `-v` flag,\n* the log files were written to a missing directory.\n\nAll of these issues have been fixed. The detailed rootThe launchd job was never reporting because:\n\n* the script path in the plist pointed to a non‑existent location,\n* the script lacked execute permission,\n* it used `$HOME`‑based paths that don’t exist in the snapshot,\n* it called GNU `date` with the macOS‑specific `-v` flag,\n* the log files were written to a missing directory.\n\nAll of these issues have been fixed. The detailed root‑cause analysis and the exact changes made are documented in **[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/2eb3fca0-02ee-4064-a21b-6f7d494bc3a9/ANSWER.md)**. You can now load and start the job with `launchctl load …` and see its output in the updated log files.\n","duration_seconds":69.462322,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":14847,"output_tokens":6665,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":171648,"total_tokens":21512}}}
